Skycorp Holdings was founded in 2011, we have 3 main business:
- Solar Power Business (The core business, starting from 2011, we supply solar components and solutions to end clients);
- Consumer Electronics (This is our new business, starting from 2017, products range is from bitcon miner server to bitcoin high frequency trading, from wireless earphone to fast charger, from data cable to selfie products);
- Construction materials (This is our family business, starting from 2000, we supply pipes, valves, smart controllers to global construction companies).

